86aa2ef78bb914e4a.600x338.jpg?t=1770810250"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857550/ss_0bbd518d465a0a16addc3eaf44013d1a2bfef49c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770810250","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1857550/ss_0bbd518d465a0a16addc3eaf44013d1a2bfef49c.600x338.jpg?t=1770810250"}],"short_description":"It's 2016 and you are a money lender. You need to get rich ASAP. Invest in crack heads. Oversee unspeakable crimes. Set the old world on fire and watch the new world rear its ugly head. It's pretty simple, if you can keep your brains in your skull and your money in your pocket, then you win.","steam_appid":1857550,"support_info":{"email":"soldiergirlinteractive@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}